{"id":"imagen","lemma":"imagen","pos":"noun","rank":1000,"glosses":["image"],"ipa":"/iˈmaxen/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"imágenes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b4/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-imagen.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Puedes ver la imagen?","en":"Can you see the picture?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/104535","words":[{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to see, to spot"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"No me gusta ninguna de estas imágenes.","en":"I don't like any of these pictures.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/609178","words":[{"g":"no / not"},null,null,{"g":"nobody","l":"ninguno"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"this","l":"este"},null],"phrases":[[1,3,"like, thumbs up"]]},{"text":"¿Qué ves en la imagen?","en":"What do you see in the picture?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/551648","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"to see, to spot","l":"ver"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"A mi parecer las imágenes hablan por sí solas.","en":"It seems to me that the pictures speak for themselves.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/693392","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"to talk","l":"hablar"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"yes"},{"g":"sole","l":"solo"}],"phrases":[[0,3,"in my opinion"]]},{"text":"Es la viva imagen de su abuelo.","en":"He's just like his grandfather.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/598918","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"alive, living","l":"vivo"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"grandfather"}]}]}